{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2015-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1434412800, "end_date": 1435017599, "month_true_total": 981, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:03:52 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "16634148", "author": {"steamid": "76561198004326844", "personaname": "PrÒtótype", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/PrototypeGR/", "num_games_owned": 461, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 23345, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5396, "last_played": 1723746112, "avatar": "783b66daf56e1c54eb2098cfaec576339885220f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Nice graphics, tons of mods and game modes. The variety of the weapons are almost endless with a decent anti-cheat system. The only con in this game is that it's really CPU bound. I'm gonna remove some points from the rating because of average optimization.\n\nRating: 8/10", "timestamp_created": 1435017402, "timestamp_updated": 1438643994, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.518072307109832764", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "16633668", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040748474", "personaname": "BongBanger69", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198040748474/", "num_games_owned": 227, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 30419, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 20666, "last_played": 1533147745, "avatar": "eaa8af8c42eb5054b2f5480e58d809106f34da07"}, "language": "english", "review": "Gr8 game 10/10 IGN", "timestamp_created": 1435015479, "timestamp_updated": 1435015479, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "16633502", "author": {"steamid": "76561198164364620", "personaname": "SHEWWW", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TLCSickGaming/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 320, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 197, "last_played": 1435798414, "avatar": "2269759946b91b9416a942381c06affc8928ba6f"}, "language": "english", "review": "best game ever", "timestamp_created": 1435014812, "timestamp_updated": 1435014812, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "16630781", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024704964", "personaname": "kraxie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kraxarn/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 202, "playtime_forever": 793, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 362, "last_played": 1464038072, "avatar": "20f90d255bf2fddf78cdbce72983d831441d144e"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the buggiest and most unfinished game I've ever played.\n\nStarts game on medium settings, 20 fps, sets to ultra, 50 fps.\nThat's also a very bad framerate for having 2 r9 280x\n\nFirstly, none of the sound is working. Sound is working everywhere else, except for Arma 3.\n\nThen I got into a multiplayer game, which takes a few restarts btw. I couldn't find a single server so I had to end up just joining my friend through Steam and it worked.\n\nThen I got into a server and after waiting for all textures to load, I noticed the bad framerate.\n\nThen we started driving around for a while and even the driving is really bugged.\nIf I start going forward, I can't stop going forward and the same for going backwards.\nThen I decided to go out of it. I got thrown out high up in the air and landed so I died.\n\nAlso, a small little thing, the cursor is still visible. It flies over all monitors, but the game doesn't tab out or click anywhere, so no big deal, just a little bit annoying...\n\nOne of the buggiest games I've played in a while. :/", "timestamp_created": 1435006356, "timestamp_updated": 1435006704, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 11, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.475729316473007202", "comment_count": 4, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "16630653", "author": {"steamid": "76561198120551627", "personaname": "Juffus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Juffus/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 28561, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13596, "last_played": 1556921012, "avatar": "049116dc3827584518d1124b90aa06b7fab8d023"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really fun with friends, awesome game overall!", "timestamp_created": 1435006026, "timestamp_updated": 1435006026, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}]}